    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d131-a12">

                <pb facs="0251" n="905" sameAs="frus:frus1875v02/pg905"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 6 in 2 in No. 219.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bourboi to Captain Moore.</hi></head>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I received a communication from justice of
                    the peace, precinct No. 5, which I inclose so that you may judge what it
                    contains and act on it; it is a notice that a squad of men, don’t say how many,
                    are ready at the Cuevas, supposed to cross on this side.</p>
                <p>I remain yours,</p>
                <closer><signed>J. B. BOURBOI,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Justice of the Peace,
                            Precinct No</hi>. 4.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Captain <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moore</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Post Commander at Edinburgh.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
